'''The Forbidden Bride Pt II''' (続・禁断の花嫁, ''Zoku・Kindan no Hanayome'', '''Continued・Forbidden Bride''') is the June [[Cat Capsule#Lucky Capsule G|Lucky Ticket G]] event in [[The Battle Cats]] and [[Nyanko Daisensou]]. The enemy introduced in this event is [[Gorilliam]], an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Gory Groom]]. It was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]].

==Event==
From the back of the wedding chapel, a mighty voice rings out: "I OBJECT!"
A long lost love appears suddenly to interrupt the ceremony! Who will win the battle for the fragile(?) heart of {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Madam Bride'''}}?!<br>
Head to Legend Stages to continue the story of The {{Color|#FF0000|'''Forbidden Bride'''}} in Special Stage map {{Color|#FF0000|'''Forbidden Bride Pt II'''}}!<br>
Can you defeat the heartbroken {{Color|#FF0000|'''Gorilliam'''}}?<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Available June 16th (11:00pm) thru July 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Clear the stage to earn a new class of Lucky Tickets, the coveted "Lucky Tickets G"! Head to the normal capsule and choose the Lucky Capsules G mode to use your rewards and pick up tons of XP and valuable special items! Later stages in Forbidden Bride Pt. II will have a higher drop rate for more ticket rewards at once!

※Forbidden Bride Pt. II is available once Empire of Cats Ch 3 has been cleared.<br>
※If stages for this event does not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Lucky Tickets G!'''}}<br>
Use rewards from "Forbidden Bride Pt. II" to earn Catamins and XP packs from a new normal capsule option!<br>
Tap the button at the top of the Cat Capsules menu to select the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Lucky Capsules G'''}} option and draw using your {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Tickets G'''}} collected from this event.

※ If you own any Lucky Tickets G, the banner option to use them at the Cat Tickets menu will appear, whether an event that provides them is available or not.<br>
※ Collected Lucky Tickets G will not be lost even after the event you earned them from has ended.<br>
※ If the Lucky Capsules G option does not appear in the Cat Capsules, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

